OL,3,GNEWSAMissiles and fireworks 'thrown at
OL,4,Aemergency crews'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMissiles, fireworks and bricks have
OL,7,Fbeen thrown at emergency crews in
OL,8,F"planned violent disorder", police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FNorthumbria Police said its crews had
OL,12,Ffaced the attacks after responding to
OL,13,Freports of anti-social behaviour in the
OL,14,FWaterville Road area of Meadow Well in
OL,15,FNorth Tyneside at about 21:00 GMT on
OL,16,FThursday. Photos show riot police at
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
