OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMissiles and fireworks 'thrown at
OL,4,Aemergency crews'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the disorder was linked
OL,7,Fto misinformation about the building's
OL,8,Ffuture as a House in Multiple
OL,9,FOccupation (HMO). Police said a
OL,10,Fsupermarket was planned for the site.
OL,12,FOfficers said the behaviour was
OL,13,F"completely unacceptable" and it was
OL,14,Fsharing the information to stop
OL,15,Fspeculation which "may lead to further
OL,16,Fdisorder".
